{"bvid": "BV1GL4y1i7bs", "title": "突破英语听力口语瓶颈04｜纠正单词重音，秒变地道美音", "duration": 303, "subs": [{"cid": 445614468, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 72, "body": [{"from": 0.18, "to": 5.47, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "以英语为母语的人说每个音节的力度不一样"}, {"from": 5.47, "to": 8.33, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "而有些语言，如汉语或日语"}, {"from": 8.33, "to": 11.61, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "以相等的重音发每个音节"}, {"from": 11.61, "to": 12.51, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "比如说"}, {"from": 12.51, "to": 15.219, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "发音很重要"}, {"from": 15.219, "to": 18.259, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "发在汉中姚你听到区别了吗"}, {"from": 19.419, "to": 21.16, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "发音很重要"}, {"from": 24.1, "to": 25.4, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "根据琳达·格兰特的说法"}, {"from": 25.4, "to": 27.57, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "这本书的作者写得很好。"}, {"from": 27.57, "to": 31.59, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "如果你倾向于对每个单词和音节都重读"}, {"from": 31.59, "to": 34.37, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "你在说什么"}, {"from": 34.37, "to": 36.21, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "你可能听起来很唐突"}, {"from": 36.21, "to": 36.77, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "愤怒"}, {"from": 36.77, "to": 38.57, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "固执的或不耐烦的"}, {"from": 38.57, "to": 40.14, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "不打算"}, {"from": 41.84, "to": 46.3, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "今天重读错误的音节也可能引起误解"}, {"from": 46.3, "to": 49.82, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "让我们来谈谈英语中单词的重音规则"}, {"from": 52.38, "to": 54.12, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "在我们进入单词重音之前"}, {"from": 54.12, "to": 56.25, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "你需要理解音节"}, {"from": 56.25, "to": 58.95, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "每个词都是由音节组成的"}, {"from": 58.95, "to": 64.79, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "一个词的音节数是由它的元音数决定的"}, {"from": 64.79, "to": 65.57, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "比如说"}, {"from": 65.57, "to": 67.07, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "在狗这个词里"}, {"from": 67.07, "to": 68.99, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "有一个音节"}, {"from": 68.99, "to": 71.68, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "机器里的狗"}, {"from": 71.68, "to": 73.1, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "有两个音节"}, {"from": 74.1, "to": 76.75, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "香蕉一词中的机器"}, {"from": 76.75, "to": 78.19, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "有三个音节"}, {"from": 78.19, "to": 79.77, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "但不"}, {"from": 79.77, "to": 84.73, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "单词重音的基本规则是重音的音节要响一些"}, {"from": 84.73, "to": 85.82, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "较高"}, {"from": 85.82, "to": 87.74, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "更长更清晰"}, {"from": 87.74, "to": 88.94, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "看看这些字"}, {"from": 88.94, "to": 90.22, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "照片"}, {"from": 93.5, "to": 96.82, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "每个单词中只有一个音节重音"}, {"from": 96.82, "to": 99.66, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "但是重读的音节不一样"}, {"from": 99.84, "to": 102.42, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "你应该重读哪个音节"}, {"from": 102.42, "to": 104.32, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "有七条规则"}, {"from": 109.66, "to": 112.82, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "如果一个名词或形容词有两个音节"}, {"from": 112.82, "to": 116.32, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "重音通常在第一个音节上"}, {"from": 130.3, "to": 132.98, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "如果这个词是双音节动词"}, {"from": 132.98, "to": 135.92, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "我们一般重读第二个音节"}, {"from": 147.979, "to": 150.179, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "当一个单词以"}, {"from": 150.179, "to": 154.18, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "或者重音放在第一个音节上"}, {"from": 171.139, "to": 172.759, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "当单词以i结尾时"}, {"from": 172.759, "to": 173.139, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "c"}, {"from": 173.139, "to": 173.499, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "s"}, {"from": 173.499, "to": 175.139, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "我还是我"}, {"from": 175.139, "to": 178.2, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "重音通常在倒数第二个音节上"}, {"from": 178.2, "to": 183.11, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "这样我们就可以倒着数音节，并从末尾重读第二个音节"}, {"from": 195.5, "to": 197.18, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "当一个词以c结尾时"}, {"from": 197.18, "to": 197.9, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "t"}, {"from": 197.9, "to": 202.49, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "所有的重音通常都在倒数第三个音节上"}, {"from": 202.49, "to": 207.69, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "所以你可以倒着数音节，从末尾重读第三个音节"}, {"from": 227.58, "to": 231.94, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "复合名词是由两个或两个以上现有的单词组成的"}, {"from": 231.94, "to": 233.86, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "在大多数复合名词中"}, {"from": 233.86, "to": 236.94, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "单词重音在第一个音节上"}, {"from": 250.56, "to": 252.86, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "对于复合形容词和动词"}, {"from": 252.86, "to": 255.28, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "重音在第二个单词上"}, {"from": 255.28, "to": 257.06, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "老式的"}, {"from": 263.719, "to": 266.019, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "以下是单词重音的一般规则"}, {"from": 266.019, "to": 268.279, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "但不要太依赖他们"}, {"from": 268.279, "to": 270.68, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "因为有很多例外"}, {"from": 271.58, "to": 274.83, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "学习的最好方法是从经验中学习"}, {"from": 274.83, "to": 277.51, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "以英语为母语的人从不研究单词的重音"}, {"from": 277.51, "to": 279.419, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "但他们做得很自然"}, {"from": 279.419, "to": 282.759, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "所以试着感受语言的节奏和旋律"}, {"from": 282.759, "to": 285.299, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "通过仔细听英语口语"}, {"from": 285.299, "to": 288.169, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "在你自己的演讲中使用单词重音"}, {"from": 288.169, "to": 291.36, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "随着时间的推移，你会自然而然地掌握它"}, {"from": 292.28, "to": 294.32, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "感谢收看《我是萨宾球》"}, {"from": 294.32, "to": 295.32, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "我们下期再见"}]}]}